B.arJ=s(["The calendar defaults to the selected week, giving mobile day cells more room and larger tap targets.","Phones and tablets can swipe between weeks while showing the current week of the month.","The expand control reveals the full month and collapses back to one week on demand.","Day cell sizing, padding, and spacing now adapt to phone, tablet, and desktop layouts."],t.s)
